{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dear Marie,\n\nI will arrive in Prague today at eleven o'clock in the morning. The journey went smoothly; we crossed the Eger twice, the second time in the moonlight, on the way to Meldros. Yesterday in Töplitz I drank from the spring, bathed, and strolled in the Clary Park. The ascent to the Schlackenberg was laborious, but the view of Lowositz from the carriage, while we drove through the chain of hills in an hour and a half, compensated for the exertion.\n\nThe city here is lively. I spent the day with a quiet meal and a glass of wine. The heat abated as the sun set. I think of you and the boys in Berlin. The roads were long, but the spirit is fresher from the movement.\n\nGreetings to Karl and Immanuel.\n\nYour\nG.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795221164,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":186,"prompt_tokens":267,"total_tokens":453,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-XoB4A9W5m62Sp6ri8033LF2OEvisOWuy","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":267,"prompt_ms":386.706,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.4483370786516854,"prompt_per_second":690.4470062528122,"predicted_n":186,"predicted_ms":4315.09,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.32481081081081,"predicted_per_second":42.87280218952559}}